      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: Seems possibly improved but still happens. I think the issue likely comes down to disagreement over which client is owner caused by calling sync APIs too early when loading (by the way - it would be really nice to have a clear point where network APIs are expected to work consistently... I'll open a canny for that)",
